OL,3,ASudan army drones hit mourners and fuel
OL,4,Amarket killing more than 300 people,
OL,5,Asources say
OL,6,
OL,7,FSudan's army has been accused of
OL,8,Flaunching several drone strikes that
OL,9,Fhave reportedly killed more than 300
OL,10,Fpeople, including dozens travelling to
OL,11,Fa funeral.
OL,13,FThe death toll from strikes in two
OL,14,Fareas of West Kordofan state on Sunday
OL,15,Fevening was 150, sources told the Sudan
OL,16,FWar Observatory, which tracks the
OL,17,Fconflict that erupted in 2023 between
OL,18,Fthe army and the paramilitary Rapid
OL,19,FSupport Forces (RSF).
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
